#!/bin/sh
# The course environment is locked on purpose. See docker/dev.Dockerfile.
cat >&2 <<'MSG'
pip is disabled in the course container.

The environment is identical on all 27 laptops because it is built from
uv.lock. A pip install here would make yours differ -- and it would not even
work: it would install into a Python the course environment never uses.

To add a package:
  1. add it to pyproject.toml (or ask on the course channel)
  2. uv lock
  3. make rebuild
MSG
exit 1
